# Title: Clfs.SYS Loaded By Process Located In a Potential Suspicious Location
# ID: fb4e2211-6d08-426b-8e6f-0d4a161e3b1d
# Status: experimental
# Level: medium
# Author: X__Junior
# Date: 2025-01-20
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
# Description: Detects Clfs.sys being loaded by a process running from a potentially suspicious location. Clfs.sys is loaded as part of many CVEs exploits that targets Common Log File.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((ImageLoaded:*\\clfs.sys) AND (((process.executable:*:\\Perflogs\\* OR process.executable:*:\\Users\\Public\\* OR process.executable:*\\Temporary Internet* OR process.executable:*\\Windows\\Temp\\*)) OR (((process.executable:*:\\Users\\* AND process.executable:*\\Favorites\\*)) OR ((process.executable:*:\\Users\\* AND process.executable:*\\Favourites\\*)) OR ((process.executable:*:\\Users\\* AND process.executable:*\\Contacts\\*)) OR ((process.executable:*:\\Users\\* AND process.executable:*\\Pictures\\*)))))
